{
    "title": "Blink Beauty Cam: Photo Makeup",
    "description": "\ud83d\udca5 You want to take photos with selfie camera?\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Want to edit photos with photo retouch professionally?\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Want to own a beautiful selfie photo?\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Blink Camera - a photo editor application with makeup face filters is here to help you. No need to waste time applying makeup filters for pictures. Now you can take beautiful photos anytime, anywhere. \r\n\r\n\u26a1 Blink camera is a beauty cam with face beautifying photo filters that helps you to retouch face editor, edit face shape. You can try a variety of styles of makeup photo editing from gentle to personal. You can apply makeup to face details such as: lipstick color, eye color, mascara, eyelashes, contouring, etc. Lots of useful features for you to experience. Let's discover beauty camera together!\r\n\r\n\u26a1 Special features of Blink makeup camera app:\r\n\r\n<b> \u2705Beautiful selfie camera</b>\r\n- Take pictures with beauty selfie app\r\n- Natural selfie camera\r\n- Help you take selfies for perfect face with effect camera\r\n- Camera smooths skin, covers all imperfections with blemish remover\r\n- Support live score of the page when shooting\r\n\r\n<b> \u2705 Professional photo makeup</b>\r\n- 50+ makeup styles from gentle to personality\r\n- Makeup with trending themes: Christmas, halloween, festivals, trends...\r\n- Easily choose the right makeup style for your face\r\n- Live makeup face beauty camera\r\n- Create your own makeup\r\n- Edit face makeup: eyes, lips, eyebrows, blush\u2026.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2705 Face retouch</b>\r\n-Detailed editing of each facial contour, retouch face change shape\r\n- Shorten the wings of the nose, correct the high nose\r\n- Face filter and face reduction, skinny filter\r\n- Fix eyes, remove dark circles\r\n- Edit faces in pictures: smooth skin with pimple remover, remove acne\r\n- Whitener skin\r\n- Tooth whitening\r\n\r\n<b> \u2705 Change hair color</b>\r\n- Support to change hair color on photo with AI camera\r\n- Change hair color to hot trend hair colors without wearing real hair\r\n- Help you choose the most suitable hair color for your Face\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udca5 Pro tools for image editor</b>\r\n- Crop photo with ratio: 16:9, 3:4, 1:1\r\n- Set time to take photo\r\n- Flash mode\r\n- Photo enhancer\r\n- Touch capture mode: Touch any point on the screen to take a photo\r\n- Snapshot mode: Save photos directly to Photo Album\r\n- Store photos on the app\r\n\r\n<b> \u2705 Blink Store</b>\r\n- 100+ Blink filters at store for selfie photo editor\r\n- Featured, easy-to-find filter themes: Trend, festival, nature, personality, anniversary\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcaf An extremely high-quality photo makeup editor application. What are you waiting for, experience Blink selfie apps with pretty filters right away and show us your beautiful photos. \r\n\r\n\u2764 We always work hard to bring the best features, so if you have any suggestions about the makeup face beauty camera app, leave a comment below.\r\n\ud83d\udc49Contact and support: thaocp1997@gmail.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udca5 You want to take photos with selfie camera?<br>\ud83d\udca5 Want to edit photos with photo retouch professionally?<br>\ud83d\udca5 Want to own a beautiful selfie photo?<br><br>\ud83d\udc49 Blink Camera - a photo editor application with makeup face filters is here to help you. No need to waste time applying makeup filters for pictures. Now you can take beautiful photos anytime, anywhere. <br><br>\u26a1 Blink camera is a beauty cam with face beautifying photo filters that helps you to retouch face editor, edit face shape. You can try a variety of styles of makeup photo editing from gentle to personal. You can apply makeup to face details such as: lipstick color, eye color, mascara, eyelashes, contouring, etc. Lots of useful features for you to experience. Let&#39;s discover beauty camera together!<br><br>\u26a1 Special features of Blink makeup camera app:<br><br><b> \u2705Beautiful selfie camera</b><br>- Take pictures with beauty selfie app<br>- Natural selfie camera<br>- Help you take selfies for perfect face with effect camera<br>- Camera smooths skin, covers all imperfections with blemish remover<br>- Support live score of the page when shooting<br><br><b> \u2705 Professional photo makeup</b><br>- 50+ makeup styles from gentle to personality<br>- Makeup with trending themes: Christmas, halloween, festivals, trends...<br>- Easily choose the right makeup style for your face<br>- Live makeup face beauty camera<br>- Create your own makeup<br>- Edit face makeup: eyes, lips, eyebrows, blush\u2026.<br><br><b>\u2705 Face retouch</b><br>-Detailed editing of each facial contour, retouch face change shape<br>- Shorten the wings of the nose, correct the high nose<br>- Face filter and face reduction, skinny filter<br>- Fix eyes, remove dark circles<br>- Edit faces in pictures: smooth skin with pimple remover, remove acne<br>- Whitener skin<br>- Tooth whitening<br><br><b> \u2705 Change hair color</b><br>- Support to change hair color on photo with AI camera<br>- Change hair color to hot trend hair colors without wearing real hair<br>- Help you choose the most suitable hair color for your Face<br><br><b>\ud83d\udca5 Pro tools for image editor</b><br>- Crop photo with ratio: 16:9, 3:4, 1:1<br>- Set time to take photo<br>- Flash mode<br>- Photo enhancer<br>- Touch capture mode: Touch any point on the screen to take a photo<br>- Snapshot mode: Save photos directly to Photo Album<br>- Store photos on the app<br><br><b> \u2705 Blink Store</b><br>- 100+ Blink filters at store for selfie photo editor<br>- Featured, easy-to-find filter themes: Trend, festival, nature, personality, anniversary<br><br>\ud83d\udcaf An extremely high-quality photo makeup editor application. What are you waiting for, experience Blink selfie apps with pretty filters right away and show us your beautiful photos. <br><br>\u2764 We always work hard to bring the best features, so if you have any suggestions about the makeup face beauty camera app, leave a comment below.<br>\ud83d\udc49Contact and support: thaocp1997@gmail.com",
